WEBVTT

00:50:58.875 --> 00:51:01.476
That happens, but this
is not the primary thing.

00:51:01.500 --> 00:51:04.601
People leave for management reasons,
relationship reasons,

00:51:04.625 --> 00:51:07.768
they were not promoted enough,
seen enough, acknowledged,

00:51:07.792 --> 00:51:11.476
and so it becomes identity questions.

00:51:11.500 --> 00:51:16.601
I think work today is organized
around an identity economy.

00:51:16.625 --> 00:51:20.726
So that's where I see
the passion thing, that drive.

00:51:20.750 --> 00:51:22.227
Now, where do you see the most?

00:51:22.251 --> 00:51:25.434
My guess is ... What do you do

00:51:25.458 --> 00:51:27.601
when a person comes
to present a thing to you

00:51:27.625 --> 00:51:29.518
and they're going to change the world?

00:51:29.542 --> 00:51:32.559
I mean, how many people come
to present to you an enterprise?